[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5953.99, "timestamp": "01:39:13", "text": "為什麼要在這個時候騎車？ [音樂] 當時是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5966.31, "timestamp": "01:39:26", "text": "呃，我該怎麼回去？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5969.83, "timestamp": "01:39:29", "text": "我他媽在哪裡？我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5973.669, "timestamp": "01:39:33", "text": "它告訴我上這座橋。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5976.629, "timestamp": "01:39:36", "text": "但我身處這荒郊野外。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5978.31, "timestamp": "01:39:38", "text": "身處建築工地。我應該反其道而行"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5980.79, "timestamp": "01:39:40", "text": "。  他媽的。我得回去。  好的，我覺得背上有東西。我勒個去？  呃，"}]